  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-03.htm",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: Have you heard of Nebulite? It is a mineral often found in meteorites. Processed properly, even a tiny amount can produce tremendous energy. It is quite valuable to those who seek to amplify magical power. The Dwarves say that Nebulite was used by the Titans as their primary sour…",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; level >= 40; player.isInCategory(CategoryType.WIZARD_GROUP)"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Where can Nebulite be found?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-04.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-04.htm",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-04.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-02.htm",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: This job is too much for you. It is far too dangerous for one of your skill level. (This quest can only be undertaken by a Mystic of level 40 or higher.)",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; NOT level >= 40; player.isInCategory(CategoryType.WIZARD_GROUP)"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-01.htm",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: We need someone to gather materials for a research project that is being conducted at Hardin's Academy. It is imperative that this person be cognizant of the forces of magic. If you know a well-trained Mystic, send him to me. (This quest can only be undertaken by non-Orc Mystics …",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; !player.isInCategory(CategoryType.WIZARD_GROUP)"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-06.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: Please collect Nebulite Orbs and bring them to us. If you kill the manashen gargoyles, enchanted monster eyes, enchanted stone golems, and enchanted iron golems that can be found around the crater of the Ivory Tower, you can easily obtain the Nebulite. And if you happen to run in…",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; lacks items 4364"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Tell me more about the Dwarven collectors.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-06a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-06a.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-06a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-07.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: Good job! So, what do you wnat? Do you want Adena in exchange for the orbs or would you prefer trading them for useful items? You may find a few things among the exchange items that you haven't seen elsewhere. If you have any question, please ask me. I'll answer your question.",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; has items 4364"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Ask about the Cursed Bone",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-09a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-09a.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-09a.html"
    },
    {
     "text": "Ask about the Ectoplasm Liqueur",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-09b.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-09b.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-09b.html"
    },
    {
     "text": "Receive money",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-08.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-08.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-08.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-08.html",
      "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-08a.html"
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I wish to exchange the orbs for useful items.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-09.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-09.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-09.html"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I wish to continue collecting.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-11a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-11a.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-11a.html"
    },
    {
     "text": "Quit",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-10.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-10.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-10.html"
    }
   ]
