  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-04.htm",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: It is well-known that the crater of the Ivory Tower was created by a gigantic meteorite... However, not many know that the meteorite was composed almost entirely of Nebulite, and is currently locked away in the basement of the tower! Those in the Ivory Tower want to keep all the …",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I agree.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-05.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-05.htm",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-05.htm",
     "effect": "start"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I disagree.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-04a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-04a.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-04a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-04a.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-04a.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: It's too bad that those in the Ivory Tower get to keep such a valuable source of energy all to themselves. I must have misjudged your sense of right and wrong.",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-05.htm": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-05.htm",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: Will you join our research? We are investigating the use of Nebulite for the greater public good. However, we are having a hard time finding Nebulite for our study. The Dwarven collectors we hired for this task have not been heard from in over a month. Would you do this work for …",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Tell me more about the Dwarven collectors.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-06a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-06a.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-06a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-06a.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-06a.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: Collectors are dwarves who specialize in gathering rare goods. Most collectors are Bounty Hunters who belong to the Gold Key Guild. But I found out that the two dwarves that I've hired are only known for their laziness and cunning, even among collectors. I blame myself, for trust…",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-08.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-08.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: Very well, you shall be paid based on the number of Nebulite Orbs you have brought back. Unfortunately, we must still secure more orbs to conduct our research. Could you possibly go and get more orbs for us?",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I will continue collecting.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-11a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-11a.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-11a.html"
    },
    {
     "text": "Quit",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-10.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-10.html",
     "quest": 343,
     "to": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-10.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-08a.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-08a.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: Did you think I would fall for that? How stupid do I look? The nerve! How could you try to get money from me without giving me any Nebulite Orbs?",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
