  "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-09b.html": {
   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-09b.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: It is a liquor with an unusual flavor, made of ectoplasm. It is definitely an acquired taste, and not many ask for it. It will not fetch a very high price at the village. But, Lich King Icarus really loves the stuff. The students here know that if you give him a drink of it, he w…",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Return",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower 30834-09.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower",
     "event": "30834-09.html",
