   "file": "Q00343_UnderTheShadowOfTheIvoryTower/30834-11a.html",
   "quest": 343,
   "text": "Magic Trader Cema: Your help has been essential to our research, we could not do it without you. However, we do still need more samples. Please help us a little longer. Oh, if you happen to run into the Dwarven collectors near the Ivory Tower, please remind them that they signed a Contract with us.",
   "header": "Magic Trader Cema",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Tell me more about the collectors.\"",
